{
    "_comment": "TRACE-Kin v1 baseline config. EXACT settings that produced the 1,847-config benchmark in trace_doc/kinetic_regress_benchmark.csv. Do NOT change without renaming the config — reproducibility depends on this. The Tier 1 ablation (schedule_lr=true / dropout=0.15 / patience=15) regressed and is deliberately not used here.",
